  "goodToKnow": "Die Ungereimtheit is an inconsistency or something that doesn't add up, usually plural: Ungereimtheiten in einer Aussage, in den Akten. It comes from der Reim (rhyme): what doesn't rhyme doesn't fit. A related idiom is Ich kann mir keinen Reim darauf machen (I can't make sense of it). Synonyms: der Widerspruch, die Unstimmigkeit. Plural: die Ungereimtheiten."
